{"id":8867094364359,"title":"Giraffe Patchwork Style Printed Quilt, Animal Patchwork Bedding","handle":"giraffe-patchwork-style-printed-quilt-animal-patchwork-bedding","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic elegance with this charming Jeminise farmhouse quilt set, perfect for adding a cozy, timeless look to any bedroom. Featuring classic patterns, it's an ideal gift to bring warmth and tradition to your loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Elegance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed with farmhouse charm, this quilt features classic patterns and soft fabrics for a cozy, traditional aesthetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An absolutely perfect gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members like mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, or daughter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e This farmhouse quilt is available in multiple sizes, including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting your desired size, adding pillowcases, or including a custom name.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This microfiber quilt is machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for fluffier results.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from polycotton fabric for comfort and durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e